From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 15:50:01 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Adaptive threshold recalibration, faster time-boxed
 exploration with return home, one-terminal runner

- Mode selector: thresholds 0.118/0.130 (was 0.15/0.20, never reached in MIXED cave),
  optional auto calibration, vectorised colouring (bit-identical, ~400 ms -> ~4 ms)
- mission_manager.py: explore within a 40 min cap, return to start pose in time
- Follower/planner/frontier tuning for speed (0.35 m/s) and fewer revisits
- Metrics logger: wait for sim clock, mission columns, home goal not counted
- cave_evaluation: localisation/pipeline launches and run_experiments.sh

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015R2bYHpJvhpt3y4gf57nAs
